ags/build requires \"typescript\" as a peer dependency` (the ESM\n  dist/vite.js has no `require`). This happens at config load, which\n  never touches src/factory.ts, so it predates this ticket and is not\n  caused by it. Not fixed (out of scope).\nEOF\ngit add AGENTS.md CONTEXT.md README.md && git commit -qm \"Document microtask teardown for hosts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && git status --short && git log --oneline -3"}}}
